# Project intent

PyQt6 kiosk for (usually) small touchscreens. Gives MIDI keyboard player ability to switch software VSTs.

`app/main.py` is novice-editable: categories, `Patch(...).add(...)` lists, and `AppConfig` rack indexes. Do not move that catalog into the package. Keep the sequential `.add` style and the existing explanatory comments.

# Layout (do not flatten)

```
app/main.py                      catalog + AppConfig construction
app/carla_interface/ui/          layout, widgets, palettes — no OSC/MIDI strings
app/carla_interface/services/    PatchController, CarlaOsc, MidiService
app/assets/stylesheet.css        button/tab/stepper chrome
os/                              piano-PC overlay — do not touch unless asked
```

Avoid giant god files; split by responsibility when a file grows unwieldy.

Ship Linux subprocesses only (`oscsend`, `aplaymidi`, `arecordmidi`). Preview on Windows is fine; do not add `sys.platform` branches or revive `sendosc.exe` / `sendmidi`.

# Agent UI preview

This is a PyQt6 kiosk, not a browser app. After UI or CSS changes, screenshot and Read the PNG — do not skip. Never `QT_QPA_PLATFORM=offscreen`. Use the `preview-ui` skill (`app/.venv` Python 3.10; grabber stays out of `app/`).

Human launch from `app/`: `.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe main.py`. Ctrl+C quits.
